     "name": "Emmanuel Oppong",
     "email": "eoppong@gsumail.gram.edu",
     "date": "2026-03-01T09:03:29Z"
    },
    "message": "fix: handle racing show() calls and restore() conflicts\n\n- Replace boolean _opening guard with _pendingShow that stores the latest\n  requested URL/options, so concurrent callers don't silently lose requests\n- After panel creation, apply the latest pending URL if it differs from\n  the initial one\n- In restore(), dispose the restored panel if an active view already exists\n  to prevent duplicate panels from show()/restore() races",
    "tree": {
     "sha": "9f5ac165b51d8c9e8694f70b83511fa5b629fd1f",
